Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini, entah kenapa ingin\Npergi ke suatu tempat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pernah merasa begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sering kepikiran begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ingin pergi jauh ke suatu tempat\Nuntuk mencari sesuatu yang menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi biasanya setiap hari aku sibuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sampai hal-hal yang tadinya ingin\Nkucoba tanpa sadar terlupakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang ingin kuperkenalkan hari ini
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kue kereta yang mengambil motif\Ndari Kereta Api Seibu seri 4000!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kue ini tersedia dalam periode terbatas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini aku sampai rela mengeluarkan\Nbanyak uang untuk membelinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.38,0:00:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki, ayo turun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Wah, aduh!\N- Dasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.09,0:00:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Terima kasih banyak!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo! Kita juga turun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.67,0:01:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Koedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuh! Kamu keluyuran lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Terima kasih, Yacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.66,0:01:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi isinya berantakan, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.59,0:01:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya mau bagaimana lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya ujian simulasi selesai juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kue untuk perayaan enaknya makan apa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.94,0:01:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kue untuk perayaan enaknya makan apa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.29,0:01:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari ekspresimu, kayaknya\Nlumayan bisa ngerjain, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.98,0:01:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang itu jangan ditanya, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menghormati nyalimu yang besar\Npadahal sudah kelas 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi sudah waktunya kamu\Nmenentukan masa depanmu, lho.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya, sih...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sudah menemukan yang ingin kamu lakukan,\Nnanti jadi lebih semangat belajar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya, aku ingin berwisata.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ucapanmu itu nggak seperti anak\Nyang bersiap ujian masuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.14,0:02:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang kita lagi ngomongin\Nmasa depan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya kalau punya sesuatu yang disukai,\Nmemilih universitas juga jadi lebih mudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesuatu yang disukai, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.82,0:02:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku suka teh yang agak unik, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang, sih, kamu terlihat sering minum teh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, begini...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi tenang kalau di pojokan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya kamu hamster?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.34,0:02:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak boleh terlalu luas\Ndan terlalu sempit, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Universitas yang punya teh unik\Ndan pojokan nyaman? Aneh banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, gawat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ada kelas tambahan di tempat les!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Terus kue perayaannya gimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hasil ujian simulasinya jelek, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kue perayaannya lain kali saja.\NSana beli buku referensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai nanti, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Yacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kue perayaan dan buku\Nreferensi beda banget, tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmm... sudah bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmm! Hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, permisi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, tidak apa-apa.\NAku juga kikuk, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ujung Jepang paling barat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, apakah kamu tertarik?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Aku cuma berpikir\Ngambarnya bagus banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, 'kan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Maaf, kamu juga setuju, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tempat penuh kenangan\Nbersama teman-temanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benar-benar suka pemandangan itu,\Njadi aku minta gambar yang detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini gambar yang dibuat sampai hasil akhirnya\Nsesuai dengan yang aku inginkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku yang merancang acara ini, jadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.85,0:04:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi grogi karena ini pertama kali...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yakin ini bakal jadi acara yang seru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau berkenan, silakan datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang ini
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}benar-benar totalitas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bo-Bolehkah saya datang?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Serius? Siapa sangka! Hore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eng...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, silakan ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, anu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apakah barang bawaannya tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.36,0:04:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Maaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:05:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa, ya? Padahal dia sudah dewasa,\Ntapi aku merasa dekat dengan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang yang tadi berdiri di situ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ih! Ramai banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tepat waktu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Permisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Silakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gantungan kunci kereta!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya orang yang suka sama kereta, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat siang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya Nishiura Arisa\Ndari bagian humas Kereta Api Matsuura!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih telah datang hari ini
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di pameran produk kereta api\Npaling barat Jepang
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dari Pariwisata Kereta Api Matsuura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong soal ujung paling barat Jepang,\Nada Jalur Monorel Perkotaan Okinawa, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terkadang ada yang mengoreksi demikian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagai jalur kereta api konvensional\Nyang berjalan di atas dua rel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ini benar-benar dapat disebut\Nsebagai jalur kereta api paling barat di Jepang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.35,0:06:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah dicatat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan beli sertifikat pengunjung ini\Nsaat mengunjungi Stasiun Tabira-Hiradoguchi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di Jalur Kereta Api Matsuura,\Ntitik paling barat dari jalur tersebut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja, kami juga punya versi\Ntiket fisik yang penuh nostalgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Pemasarannya berlebihan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya pikir mumpung ada kesempatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bicarakan saja hal\Nyang diminati pengunjung?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Topik pembicaraan tadi seru, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang-orang di lokasi acara\Nfokus pada pembicaraannya...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jalur Kereta Api Matsuura\Nyang melewati kota kelahiran saya
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}memiliki begitu banyak hal menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, bagi kalian yang hadir di sini
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}silakan berkunjung ke Kereta Api Matsuura!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:07:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah kenapa... Terlihat...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keren!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya, terima kasih\Nsudah datang hari ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat berbelanja setelah ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.81,0:07:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apakah yang dijual di sini pilihan dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih sudah datang hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beli oleh-oleh juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah... Saat melihat-lihat,\Naku jadi mau ini-itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia karakter dari Kereta Api Matsuura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, samaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maaf...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada banyak pengunjung dan kamera,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:08:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi Kakak bisa banyak bicara\Nsoal hal yang Kakak sukai di atas panggung.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eng... Eng...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak keren!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kesannya kayak anak SD!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu... Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah aku sudah berjuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada orang yang berjuang\Ntanpa sepengetahuanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada orang yang bekerja keras membuat\Nsesuatu yang aku anggap biasa saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang ini yang mengajarkanku arti keren.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku bisa menjadi sepertinya kelak?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki! Kita satu kereta, toh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:08:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pulang telat banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dapat buku referensi bagus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau berusaha untuk mencari\Nhal yang ingin kulakukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh, tuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau bikin catatan dulu,\Njadi aku beli buku catatan imut!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu juga boleh, tapi kamu harus\Nbelajar ujian juga, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.99,0:09:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku tahu, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak tahu tentang masa depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga aku menemukan sesuatu\Nyang menyenangkan nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.07,0:09:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai hari ini, aku jadi mahasiswi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak kusangka kamu memilih\Nkampus yang sama denganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, pokoknya jangan bosan\Nberteman sama aku lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:10:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupikir kamu bakal masuk\NUniversitas Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.33,0:10:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya ada seminar yang ingin kuikuti.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seminar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.65,0:10:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mahasiswa banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baru bisa masuk\Nsetelah tahun ketiga, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus pamer kebolehan sebelum itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal baru selesai ujian,\Nkamu mau belajar lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita, 'kan, masuk kampus buat belajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sih.... Ya, memang, sih...\NGimana kalau coba hal lain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, yang kamu bilang\Nmau mencoba sesuatu itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya! Masa kuliah itu masa peralihan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, pertama...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batu bata?! Ini semua materi matkulnya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuliah ternyata susah banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.13,0:10:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Kok kamu lancar banget?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, aku sudah memutuskan mau ikut\Nmatkul apa sebelum diterima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seniorku bilang matkul\Nterkenal bakal cepat penuh,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi sebaiknya ditandai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:11:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seniormu? Sejak kapan kenal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku tertinggal sendirian!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, teman senasib?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yagami, kamu sudah tahun ketiga, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang ada susahnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi ada minuman yang kamu sukai\Ndi mesin swasaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada kue juga di kantin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teh kedelai enak kayak minum kinako, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang kinako cocok sama kue?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perpaduan Jepang-Barat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku suka bagian yang renyah di pinggir itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Enakan buahnya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kumpul di halaman tengah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senior ketiduran lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Konsernya jam berapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Konser? Halaman tengah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.87,0:12:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, sirkel! Mahasiswa banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mahasiswa itu sirkel!\NSirkel itu kampus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan, kamu mau masuk mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak mau ikut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Padahal mumpung kuliah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jarang nyambi kerja,\Njadi tidak punya uang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.67,0:12:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, mumpung ada waktu,\Nlihat-lihat saja dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langkah pertama mencari\Nhal yang ingin kulakukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo berangkat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tertarik lakrose? Ramah pemula!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Klub Rakugo! Kamu suka komedi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah jadi mahasiswi,\Nayo lebih aktif lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo main permainan papan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Klub Sulap mengincar\Nperingkat satu tahun ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Informasi... Gelombang informasi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.13,0:12:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, ini sambutan kuliah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak wajah di depanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak uluran tangan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Titik mengungsi darurat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu, aku mau tinggal di sini mulai hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ih, sudah tidak ada tempat lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita bukan sirkel besar,\Npakai tempat seadanya saja, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu yang bilang ingin menarik\Nminat anak baru, 'kan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sih...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sirkel seperti kita ada di tengah\Nmalah jadi mencolok, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana bisa dapat anggota\Nkalau pikiranmu negatif begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus lebih proaktif!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Kamu anak mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak tersesat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diriku di masa depan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, maksudnya kamu boleh\Nduduk di kursi itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Ah, kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia baik banget, cuma agak pemalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Klub Tetsuryo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Klub Pencinta Wisata Kereta Api.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kesannya kaku kalau ditulis pakai kanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.63,0:14:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadinya kami tulis pakai hiragana,\N"Klub Tetsuryo"!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kereta api...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, intinya sirkel penggemar\Nnaik kereta api.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penggemar... naik kereta?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penggemar kereta api\Nyang senang menaiki kereta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah penggemar naik kereta!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan sekadar moda transportasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang bisa kamu temui\Nsaat menaiki kereta api!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak hal yang dapat dilihat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu kebablasan lagi, Kodama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:15:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama jadi begitu kalau bahas kereta api.\NHati-hati, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia terlalu banyak ngomong tahun lalu,\Nanak baru jadi kabur semua.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu-satunya yang tinggal cuma Usa di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.81,0:15:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia ini rajanya kebablasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah banyak minta maaf, 'kan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bukan otaku yang suka memaksa, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga menerima pemula!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru, aku lebih suka berbagi\Ndan cari teman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuh, kamu ngomong sendiri lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, ti-tidak apa-apa.\NAku tidak tahu sesuatu sampai detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutku, kamu hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak yang baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pelecehan begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pe-Pelecehan? Enggak, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami melarang keras\Npelecehan dan perundungan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk mencegah hal seperti ini terulang,\Naku akan belajar tata tertib lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bikin bingung!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya. Raja kebablasan kami\Nrasa bertanggung jawabnya tinggi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Abaikan saja perkataan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ti-Tidak bisa begitu... Dia seniorku...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu memang anak baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terimalah ini sebagai\Ntanda perkenalan kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Papan petunjuk stasiun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurang banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau mau memancingnya dengan barang,\Nberikan barang yang dia sukai, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya lewat stasiun itu\Nkalau mau ke kampus,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kupikir bakal membuatnya familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.15,0:16:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mending kita jadi Komunitas\NPenikmat Bekal Stasiun, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kita menyiapkan bahan untuk dicicipi,\Nanggaran klub kita bisa habis, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang tugas ketua mengurus itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti bisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anggarannya nanti habis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Usahakan, dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang tidak bisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Debatnya pasti lama kalau sudah begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Bagaimana kalau lihat-lihat\Npas kami ada kegiatan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo? Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Duh! Gara-gara kamu\Nngomong enggak penting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu harusnya hentikan dia juga, Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada gunanya\Nkalau dipaksa bergabung.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah ketemu sirkel bagus?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada banyak sirkel yang kelihatannya seru.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya kamu belum memutuskan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.83,0:17:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, tidak usah terpaku sama sirkel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki punya daftar hal\Nyang ingin kamu lakukan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daftar hal yang ingin kulakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Kamu lupa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah! Itu, toh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tidak salah di sekitar sini...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketemu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Membaca semua komik yang sedang kubaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan tiga es krim sekaligus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidur 10 jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.49,0:17:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pas SMA blak-blakan banget sama hasratku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berwisata, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kereta tujuan Hon-Kawagoe segera tiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hon-Kawagoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}(Klub Penelitian Bulan\NMenerima Anggota Baru)\NKayaknya aku pernah lihat...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tujuan akhir kereta ini, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya. Kalau sampai ujung\Nbisa sampai tempat itu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu itu, aku sibuk belajar jadinya lupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sekarang...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kampusku kelewatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih telah menggunakan\Nlayanan Jalur Seibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah kereta ekspres\Nmenuju Hon-Kawagoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku terlalu impulsif?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kota yang sama sekali tidak kuketahui.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi deg-degan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar sampai ujung!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.03,0:19:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku cuma naik kereta untuk sampai tujuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata bisa mengantarku\Nke tempat seindah ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat terharu dengan\Nhal yang sangat lumrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa Yacchan suka ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan berwisata, sih,\Ntapi sudah tercapai setengahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar lagi kita tiba di Kami-Shakujii.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pintu keluar ada di sebelah kiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pemandangan yang pernah kulihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah pulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka pergi ke tempat seperti apa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Klub Tetsuryo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum pernah dengar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin di ruang pojokan sana?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketemu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Permisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku boleh masuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maaf! Aku masuk\Nsoalnya pintunya terbuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, kamu mau mendaftar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:21:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemarin, aku naik kereta sampai ujung tujuan.\NRasanya seru banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.23,0:21:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga ingin pergi\Nke banyak tempat lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.10,0:21:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin bakal lebih seru\Nkalau bersama kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak boleh karena perasaan semacam itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu dia inti prinsip Klub Tetsuryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Prinsip? Serius banget, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi senang, ya, Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu cemas dia bakal\Ndatang lagi atau tidak, 'kan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Selamat datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari berkenalan lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.79,0:21:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku Orihara Kodama.\NKetua Klub Tetsuryo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, yang ceria ini\Nnamanya Yagami Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami tahun ketiga.\NTerus, dia tahun kedua, Harutachi Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.81,0:21:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sa-Salam kenal, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang di Klub Tetsuryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eng, siapa namamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sa-Sada Misaki!\NMohon bimbingannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.00,0:22:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Subtitle provided by: Yuramedia Link
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.81,0:22:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penerjemah: Rasyid Yudhanto Kurniawan\NTiming: Bayu Surya Perdana\NPemeriksa Akhir: Nail Basalamah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Klub Tetsuryo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.51,0:23:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kegiatannya berwisata naik kereta.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.91,0:23:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, biasanya ngapain?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak mungkin berwisata tiap minggu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.33,0:23:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.93,0:23:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu masuk tanpa tahu itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, "Klub Tetsuryo Itu Apa?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bakal tanya kegiatannya apa!
